  moduleId: MC_002
  moduleTitle: Trivium
  moduleText: 'Trivium is a modern heavy metal band part of the american metalcore
    scene. Throughout their career they have also included aspects of other subgenres
    such as thrash and progressive metal. Their heaviest album is In Waves, followed
    by Shogun and Ascendancy. Normally they close their concert performances with
    the song In Waves. Original members: Matt (Guitar and Vocals), Corey (Lead Guitar),
    Paolo (Bass)'
  questions:
  - questionId: Q_001
    questionText: From what country are Trivium?
    answerOptions:
    - Japan
    - England
    - USA
    - Germany
    correctAnswerIndex: 2
    timeLimitSeconds: 30
    basePoints: 100
    speedBonusPoints: 50
  - questionId: Q_002
    questionText: What other subgenre can be found in their musical carrer?
    answerOptions:
    - Thrash
    - Power
    - Slam
    - Death
    correctAnswerIndex: 0
    timeLimitSeconds: 30
